{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfPzzaYJYMJLPKx13nKXn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! I've successfully implemented all three changes for BE-005. Here's a summary of what was done:\n\n## Implementation Summary\n\n### 1. **Partial Fulfillment**\n- Added `quantity` field to Order and Shipment models (default 1, validated to be ≥1)\n- Added `DELIVERED` status to ShipmentStatus enum\n- Implemented fulfillment tracking with `allocated`, `delivered`, and `status` (DELIVERED, FULLY_ALLOCATED, PARTIALLY_ALLOCATED, UNALLOCATED)\n- Added shipment state transitions:\n  - `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm` (CREATED → CONFIRMED)\n  - `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/deliver` (CONFIRMED → DELIVERED)  \n  - `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/cancel` (CREATED → CANCELLED)\n- Validates that shipments don't exceed order quantity (409 CONFLICT)\n- Quantity cancellation properly releases allocated quantity\n- Added `PUT /orders/{orderId}/quantity` to amend order quantity with validation\n- Added `GET /orders?fulfilment=STATUS` to filter orders by fulfillment status\n\n### 2. **Customer Validation**\n- Orders now require a valid customer, rejecting unknown customers with 422 UNPROCESSABLE_ENTITY\n- `GET /customers/{customerId}` now returns 404 through error envelope\n- Updated OrderControllerTest to create test customers before creating orders\n- Updated CustomerControllerTest to verify error envelope for unknown customers\n\n### 3. **Paged Lists**\n- All list endpoints (`/customers`, `/orders`, `/shipments`) now support pagination with:\n  - `limit` parameter (1-100, default 100)\n  - `offset` parameter (0+, default 0)\n  - `X-Total-Count` header with pre-filter total\n- Proper HTTP 400 validation for invalid limit/offset values\n- On `/orders`, total count reflects fulfillment filter\n\n### Additional Changes\n- Added `UnprocessableEntityException` for 422 responses\n- Added new error codes: `CUSTOMER_NOT_FOUND` and `CONFLICT`\n- Updated repositories to support pagination and filtering\n- All errors consistently use the API error envelope\n\n**Build Status**: ✅ All 13 tests passing, no new dependencies added, no unrelated changes."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":654,"cache_read_input_tokens":66038,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":654},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1a06ad96-7b4c-4487-89bf-04651a74ba99","uuid":"6a9e4ef3-b5d7-47a3-8e69-fc946a0c153c","timestamp":"2026-09-25T10:29:08.558Z","request_id":"req_011CfPzza71YCThtyD5m4TT3"}
